        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Fingerlings 2, The Mysterious Production of Eggs\n- People: Andrew Bird, Nora O'Connor\n- Organizations: My Morning Jacket\n- Places: Louisville, Kentucky\n- Topics: live releases, live renditions\n\nFacts:\n- My Morning Jacket is an American rock band that was formed in Louisville, Kentucky in 1998.\n- Fingerlings 2 is the second album in Andrew Bird's series of live releases.\n- Andrew Bird self-released Fingerlings 2 in 2004.\n- Fingerlings 2 features appearances by My Morning Jacket and Nora O'Connor.\n- Fingerlings 2 includes five live renditions of tracks that were featured on Andrew Bird's 2005 release The Mysterious Production of Eggs.",
